    "body": "### Pre-submission Checklist\n\n- [x] I have searched the existing issues and this bug has not been reported yet\n- [x] I have tested this issue on the [demo site](https://demo.usememos.com) or the latest version\n\n### Where did you encounter this bug?\n\nLatest stable version (self-hosted)\n\n### Memos Version\n\nv0.26.0\n\n### Bug Description\n\nThe nested checklist cannot display levels correctly; all items appear on the same level. Furthermore, clicking the checkbox of a sub-checklist incorrectly marks the item above it. The syntax for nested checklists was correctly supported in previous versions.\n\n<img width=\"1072\" height=\"370\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d7f688e8-a11d-46de-a1fe-1600100f971e\" />\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n\nThe testing markdown is\n```markdown\n- [ ] task1\n    - [ ] task1.1\n        - [ ] task 1.1.1\n    - [ ] task1.2 \n- [ ] task2\n```\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\n_No response_\n\n### Screenshots & Additional Context\n\n_No response_",
